//
// SMU Verilator coverage configuration. Passed to Verilator at compile time
// from [coverage.verilator].build_args in smu_sim_cfg.toml.
//
// Every covergroup handle of the cov/sv collectors stays a member of its
// instance. A handle whose samples are all gated off in a build is otherwise
// local to static initialization: its object is freed there while its bins
// stay registered, and coverage.dat reads their counts from freed memory.
`verilator_config
public -module "smu_*_fcov" -var "u_cg_*"
